{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"node-030","type":"group","x":1830,"y":730,"width":900,"height":560,"label":"困難案例才加開的候選（opt-in）"},
		{"id":"node-002","type":"group","x":-70,"y":-100,"width":480,"height":780,"label":"初始化來源（擇一）"},
		{"id":"node-003","type":"text","text":"**Random init**\n\n`ELECTRO_JACOBI_MODE=off`\n\n隨機初始座標","x":0,"y":-40,"width":340,"height":170,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-004","type":"text","text":"**Jacobi 暖啟動**\n（生產預設 replace）\n\nb2b 連線圖做\n20 輪鄰居平均","x":0,"y":180,"width":340,"height":190,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-032","type":"text","text":"**escalated adaptive-seed**\n`ELECTRO_ADAPTIVE_SEED=N`\n\n給難案例再加 N 個\n額外 jacobi seed","x":2300,"y":830,"width":400,"height":190,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-033","type":"text","text":"最佳已驗證組合：adaptive-spectral + escalated(SEED=3)\n+ 池無關 proxy = **1.7279**（約 2× runtime，opt-in，非預設）","x":1860,"y":1090,"width":840,"height":130,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-040","type":"text","text":"**Proxy Cost 排名**\n\n預設：候選池平均正規化\n\nopt-in 池無關：\n`ELECTRO_PROXY_ABSAREA`\n`ELECTRO_PROXY_ABSHPWL`","x":1230,"y":820,"width":380,"height":260,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node-005","type":"text","text":"**Spectral / GiFt**\n（opt-in `ELECTRO_SPECTRAL=1`）\n\nanchored quadratic\nplacement，一步求解","x":0,"y":420,"width":340,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-011","type":"text","text":"## Stage 2\n**legalize()**\n\n1. 順序抽取\n2. 貪婪 或 LP 壓實\n   （LP 生產預設已開）\n3. `_cleanup()` 保底\n   （PUSH_GAP=1e-4）","x":1230,"y":-50,"width":380,"height":340,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-012","type":"text","text":"## Stage 3\n**soft_repair()**\n\nboundary snap\n+ wide-swap（預設開）\n\ngrouping\npush-past（預設開）","x":1830,"y":-35,"width":380,"height":310,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-031","type":"text","text":"**adaptive spectral**\n`ELECTRO_SPECTRAL_ADAPTIVE=1`\n\n只有 proxy 判斷困難\n（best_600_score ≥ 門檻，\n預設 1.5）才加跑","x":1860,"y":810,"width":400,"height":230,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-050","type":"text","text":"## Portfolio 選擇\n\n每個候選都算一次 proxy cost，**逐案挑最低者送出**\n——不是調出單一最佳參數，是同時養一群候選","x":1175,"y":1440,"width":490,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-020","type":"text","text":"**place-compact**（生產預設開，`ELECTRO_PLACE_COMPACT=1`）\n\n把這一輪結果的中心點當新初始化，再跑一輪短版 analytical_place → 額外候選\n\n本季最大單一突破：2.1230 → 1.9666","x":1100,"y":440,"width":760,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node-001","type":"text","text":"# Electro Pipeline 架構圖\n\n完整方塊說明見同資料夾 `Electronic_Pipeline.md`。\npipeline 有結構性改動（新增/移除階段、新增生產預設開啟的機制）時同步更新此圖。","x":-70,"y":-440,"width":820,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-010","type":"text","text":"## Stage 1\n**analytical_place()**\n\nAdam 梯度下降：\nov / bb / wl /\ngrp(0.4) / mib_shape(0.05)","x":630,"y":-10,"width":380,"height":260,"color":"4"}
	],
